  "html": "<h2>The Release, Numbered</h2>\n<div class=\"pic pic-dynamic\" data-steps=\"11\" data-intro=\"Press play: the run's calls in order.\" data-captions='[]'>\n  <div class=\"pic-two\">\n  <svg class=\"pic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"C4 dynamic view of the release\"><defs><marker id=\"pic-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"context-stroke\"/></marker></defs><g class=\"node system\" data-id=\"artie\"><rect class=\"shape\" x=\"20\" y=\"170\" width=\"170\" height=\"80\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"105\" y=\"206.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">ARTIE</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"105\" y=\"220.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">the release desk</text></g><g class=\"node system\" data-id=\"replies\"><rect class=\"shape\" x=\"20\" y=\"360\" width=\"170\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"105\" y=\"386.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Desk replies</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"105\" y=\"400.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">RISE replies, resting</text></g><g class=\"node system\"><rect class=\"shape\" x=\"330\" y=\"20\" width=\"190\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"425\" y=\"46.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Forge gateway</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"425\" y=\"60.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">GitHub · GitLab</text></g><g class=\"node system\"><rect class=\"shape\" x=\"330\" y=\"140\" width=\"190\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"425\" y=\"166.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Watcher</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"425\" y=\"180.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">RISE</text></g><g class=\"node system\"><rect class=\"shape\" x=\"330\" y=\"260\" width=\"190\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"425\" y=\"286.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">CI wrapper</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"425\" y=\"300.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">in front of Jenkins</text></g><g class=\"node system\"><rect class=\"shape\" x=\"330\" y=\"380\" width=\"190\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"425\" y=\"406.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Preview</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"425\" y=\"420.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">the built library</text></g><g class=\"node system\"><rect class=\"shape\" x=\"640\" y=\"200\" width=\"150\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"715\" y=\"226.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Dev</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"715\" y=\"240.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">environments</text></g><g class=\"edge heart\" data-at=\"1\"><path d=\"M190 178 C260 178 280 36 328 36\" marker-end=\"url(#pic-arrow)\"/><g class=\"num\"><circle cx=\"267.25\" cy=\"107\" r=\"9\"/><text x=\"267.25\" y=\"110.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text></g></g><g class=\"edge heart\" data-at=\"2\"><path d=\"M190 205 C260 205 290 166 328 166\" marker-end=\"url(#pic-arrow)\"/><g class=\"num\"><circle cx=\"271\" cy=\"185.5\" r=\"9\"/><text x=\"271\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text></g></g><g class=\"edge own\" data-at=\"3\"><path d=\"M425 138 C425 118 425 100 425 82\" marker-end=\"url(#pic-arrow)\"/><g class=\"num\"><circle cx=\"425\" cy=\"109.25\" r=\"9\"/><text x=\"425\" y=\"112.75\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text></g></g><g class=\"edge rise\" data-at=\"4\"><path d=\"M330 192 C260 250 240 330 192 374\" marker-end=\"url(#pic-arrow)\"/><g class=\"num\"><circle cx=\"252.75\" cy=\"288.25\" r=\"9\"/><text x=\"252.75\" y=\"291.75\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text></g></g><g class=\"edge heart\" data-at=\"5\"><path d=\"M190 190 C270 190 290 64 328 64\" marker-end=\"url(#pic-arrow)\"/><g class=\"num\"><circle cx=\"274.75\" cy=\"127\" r=\"9\"/><text x=\"274.75\" y=\"130.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text></g></g><g class=\"edge heart\" data-at=\"6\"><path d=\"M190 222 C260 222 290 280 328 280\" marker-end=\"url(#pic-arrow)\"/><g class=\"num\"><circle cx=\"271\" cy=\"251\" r=\"9\"/><text x=\"271\" y=\"254.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text></g></g><g class=\"edge own\" data-at=\"7\"><path d=\"M425 322 C425 340 425 360 425 378\" marker-end=\"url(#pic-arrow)\"/><g class=\"num\"><circle cx=\"425\" cy=\"350\" r=\"9\"/><text x=\"425\" y=\"353.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7</text></g></g><g class=\"edge rise\" data-at=\"8\"><path d=\"M330 310 C270 340 240 380 192 396\" marker-end=\"url(#pic-arrow)\"/><g class=\"num\"><circle cx=\"256.5\" cy=\"358.25\" r=\"9\"/><text x=\"256.5\" y=\"361.75\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text></g></g><g class=\"edge heart\" data-at=\"9\"><path d=\"M190 238 C260 238 290 302 328 302\" marker-end=\"url(#pic-arrow)\"/><g class=\"num\"><circle cx=\"271\" cy=\"270\" r=\"9\"/><text x=\"271\" y=\"273.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">9</text></g></g><g class=\"edge heart\" data-at=\"10\"><path d=\"M150 252 C150 380 260 412 328 412\" marker-end=\"url(#pic-arrow)\"/><g class=\"num\"><circle cx=\"213.5\" cy=\"380\" r=\"9\"/><text x=\"213.5\" y=\"383.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10</text></g></g><g class=\"edge heart\" data-at=\"11\"><path d=\"M190 214 C320 230 500 232 638 230\" marker-end=\"url(#pic-arrow)\"/><g class=\"num\"><circle cx=\"411\" cy=\"228.75\" r=\"9\"/><text x=\"411\" y=\"232.25\" text-anchor=\"middle\">11</text></g></g></svg>\n  <ol class=\"pic-calls\">\n    <li class=\"keep heart\" data-at=\"1\"><b>1</b><span><strong>ARTIE → forge</strong> GET 501 <code>scm:pulls-get</code></span></li>\n    <li class=\"keep heart\" data-at=\"2\"><b>2</b><span><strong>ARTIE → watcher</strong> POST watch <code>watcher:watch</code></span></li>\n    <li class=\"keep own\" data-at=\"3\"><b>3</b><span><strong>watcher → forge</strong> looks at 501 until it offers scm:merge <code>own</code></span></li>\n    <li class=\"keep rise\" data-at=\"4\"><b>4</b><span><strong>watcher → desk reply</strong> answers <code>RISE</code></span></li>\n    <li class=\"keep heart\" data-at=\"5\"><b>5</b><span><strong>ARTIE → forge</strong> PUT merge, squash <code>scm:merge</code></span></li>\n    <li class=\"keep heart\" data-at=\"6\"><b>6</b><span><strong>ARTIE → CI wrapper</strong> POST build <code>ci:build</code></span></li>\n    <li class=\"keep own\" data-at=\"7\"><b>7</b><span><strong>CI wrapper → Jenkins → preview</strong> builds, deploys <code>own</code></span></li>\n    <li class=\"keep rise\" data-at=\"8\"><b>8</b><span><strong>CI wrapper → desk reply</strong> answers <code>RISE</code></span></li>\n    <li class=\"keep heart\" data-at=\"9\"><b>9</b><span><strong>ARTIE → CI wrapper</strong> GET the build <code>hr:in-reply-to</code></span></li>\n    <li class=\"keep heart\" data-at=\"10\"><b>10</b><span><strong>ARTIE → preview</strong> the smoke script's 30 calls <code>ci:smoke-test</code></span></li>\n    <li class=\"keep heart\" data-at=\"11\"><b>11</b><span><strong>ARTIE → Dev</strong> GET environment 1, POST promote <code>env:promote</code></span></li>\n  </ol>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"sq-key pic-key\"><span><b class=\"k-heart\">━</b> HEART</span><span><b class=\"k-rise\">━</b> RISE</span><span><b class=\"k-own\">━</b> a party's own work</span></p>\n",
  "say": "Before every message, the same run in eleven numbered calls on the context boxes. C4 calls this a dynamic diagram; UML calls it a collaboration diagram. Red is HEART, green is RISE, blue is a party's own work. Notice who talks to whom: only ARTIE starts anything, and the two answers come back to its own replies, not to ARTIE itself. The next slide plays every message behind these eleven.",
